  "doc": {
    "description": "09 -- MuxN / Mux4N: parameterized multiplexers, composed hierarchically.\n\nMuxN selects between two N-bit buses with one select line, one\nAND-OR cell per bit.  Mux4N then composes three MuxN instances into\na 4-way select tree, passing its own parameter N straight through to\nthe children (§5.3).",
    "source": "circuit.shdl",
    "flattened_at": "2026-01-01T00:00:00Z"
  },
